# Fab / launcher-delivered content packs are added PER-SEAT via the Epic
# launcher's "Add to Project" and are NEVER committed: they are account
# licenses, multi-gigabyte, and re-deliverable on any seat. Each such pack
# gets an explicit ignore entry here when adopted. Only individually curated
# pieces may be committed, deliberately, outside these folders.
/Content/ParagonSevarog/

